MATAM HAI QAID-E-SHAAM MEIN BINTE HUSSAIN KA,<br>
 ZAINAB TADAP KE DETI HAI ABBAS KO SADA<br>
<br>
ZAKHMI SAFAR THA CHUP RAHI HAR ZULM SEHGAYI,<br>
 THI HAMSAFAR SAKINA KE HAR LAMHA TASHNAGI,<br>
 PESHAY NAZAR HUSSAIN KA MAQSAD THA CHUP RAHI,<br>
 IS KAM SINI MEIN THA YEH SAKINA KA HAUSLA<br>
<br>
TARIKIYAAN HAIN AUR HAIN HAR SU UDASIYAAN,<br>
 UTTHO SAKINA KEHTI HAI ROROKE BIBIYAAN,<br>
 GUM HOGAYEN KHAMOSHI MEIN BIBI KI SISKIYAAN,<br>
 BANO YEH KEHTI HAI MERI BETI KO KYA HUVA<br>
<br>
MAA KHOLTI HAI BETI KI GARDAN SE REESMAA,<br>
 HASRATH SE DEKHTI HAI TAMANCHAO KE BHI NASHAA,<br>
 AUR KEH RAHI HAI ROOTH GAYI MUJH SE MERI JAA,<br>
 ARMAAN WATAN KO JANE KA DIL HI MEIN REH GAYA<br>
<br>
KAISA AJEEB WAQT HAI SAJJAD KYA KAREY,<br>
 EK SHAMMA DASTIYAAB NAHI KIS SE KYA KAHEY,<br>
 NANHI SI KHABR BANTI HAI ZINDAAN-E-SHAAM MEIN,<br>
 HO GHUSL KAISE KAISE HO SAMAANN DAFN KA<br>
<br>
KISTARHA PURI HOGI WAISYATH SAKINA KI,<br>
 PAIHAM LAHOO RULATI HAI GURBATH SAKINA KI,<br>
 ZAINUL ABA KE HATAON PA MAYYAT SAKINA KI,<br>
 KANOU SE KHOON TAZA HAI KURTA JALA HUVA<br>
<br>
SAJJAD KEHTEY HAIN PHUPI AMMA MAIN KYA KARU,<br>
 KAISA YEH WAQT AAYA HAI MAIN KIS SE KYA KAHU,<br>
 KAISE BAHAN KO CHOD KE MAIN KARBALA CHALOON,<br>
 MAIN AAJ APNE BABA SE SHARMINDA HO GAYA<br>
<br>
AAISA HAI GHAM SAKINA KA KHOO ROTA HAI QALAM,<br>
 KISTARHA SE RASHEED MASAYAB HO AB RAQAM,<br>
 LIKHA JO MAINEY NAUHA HAI ABBAS KA KARAM,<br>
 HAR LAFZ JAISEY NAUHEY KA HAI EK MARSIYA..